### Phase 1-BE QA — Open Play Scoring

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Register a test user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Player",
  "email": "test@courtbooking.com",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@courtbooking.com",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

### Save token from login response — use as: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get sports (no auth needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoring/sports

### 4. Get rule sets
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoring/rule-sets?sportCode=PICKLEBALL

### 5. Create Singles match
POST {{baseUrl}}/scoring/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": null,
  "sportCode": "PICKLEBALL",
  "ruleSetCode": "PICKLEBALL_SIDE_OUT_11",
  "matchMode": "OpenPlay",
  "gameType": "Singles",
  "targetScore": 11,
  "winBy": 2,
  "teams": [
    {
      "teamCode": "A",
      "teamName": "Player A",
      "players": [
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Jessie", "isGuest": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "teamCode": "B",
      "teamName": "Player B",
      "players": [
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Opponent", "isGuest": true }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Create Doubles match
POST {{baseUrl}}/scoring/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": null,
  "sportCode": "PICKLEBALL",
  "ruleSetCode": "PICKLEBALL_SIDE_OUT_11",
  "matchMode": "OpenPlay",
  "gameType": "Doubles",
  "targetScore": 11,
  "winBy": 2,
  "teams": [
    {
      "teamCode": "A",
      "teamName": "Team A",
      "players": [
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Jessie", "isGuest": true },
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Partner", "isGuest": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "teamCode": "B",
      "teamName": "Team B",
      "players": [
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Opponent 1", "isGuest": true },
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Opponent 2", "isGuest": true }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Get match by id (replace {id} with actual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoring/matches/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. My history
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoring/matches/my-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Search players
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoring/players/search?query=test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Invalid — Singles with 2 players on one team (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/scoring/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": null,
  "sportCode": "PICKLEBALL",
  "ruleSetCode": "PICKLEBALL_SIDE_OUT_11",
  "matchMode": "OpenPlay",
  "gameType": "Singles",
  "targetScore": 11,
  "winBy": 2,
  "teams": [
    {
      "teamCode": "A",
      "teamName": "Player A",
      "players": [
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Jessie", "isGuest": true },
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Extra", "isGuest": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "teamCode": "B",
      "teamName": "Player B",
      "players": [
        { "registeredUserId": null, "playerName": "Opponent", "isGuest": true }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

